    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01J2CMVCT0VZMVPCN0ANXGDH57\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to set up a customized ecommerce onboarding checklist and get started with Klaviyo.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J2CMVCT0YDZMMFANH83T59M3\">Access and download the checklists</h2>\n<p>When you attempt to access one of the ecommerce checklists, it will first open in Google drive and be in view-only mode.<br><br>1. Choose your applicable ecommerce integration or SMS checklist from the list below. </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/15UJnUUb2iK6x_Oo2pD0TLaxYOGP2V342YmohDysJbLg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BigCommerce onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16c_7xVjoIrMNGx5ybXzMh-D5k2RCWlBcl7gQ9EcwM5s/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Magento 1 onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1RfyG5atAC15HXTw2WrR1KSvg9bbtCl_DjD3DF4G7Mus/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Magento 2 onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1m_JSwLmFA7-ovZHeDhG48eiKjKL3igC5qdmSt1Krd48/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenCart onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1W1xxoSLXeWSMORZZqkEfCD0gJU2AEj5etkv0W7IsmIw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PrestaShop onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VO3I1w_iXWPaJsbo3rcPGirr6-CGp9ZYebRIAeMUJac/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Salesforce Commerce Cloud onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/18jP3G-8vVml1t3GPI1o5bhd6EVbiGzIzirVMKIKlT_w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shopify onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/12NZpoenisBrtev7rRi2VJAVe2axbbXo_JORB2nYm9_s/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shopware 6 onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1K5yNKHMqVR_oBmU7pnIB1rocy3rybkTHYv9L-kvNP50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wix onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-qyrY8XXuzDL0vIwrgvpGxwjNvWanZjFMebQFHzCdLo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WooCommerce onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YctP9RGZU9ddwVoJJ1jYuQNn_KmDoSEb3PMcHP3IY5k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Custom integration onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TiCGdoM_ptc-VwbD5ZY2rQgdwfBNryl1vne9Acr6FAs/edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">US and Canada SMS onboarding checklist</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1KMyYTZPNTXzVbvGmMfilG4YgIdTVuXzaScCLJyKAupU/edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UK and Australia SMS onboarding checklist</a><br>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">It's important to follow each checklist in the specific order recommended and as outlined.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2. To make your own editable copy, go to <strong>File &gt; Make a Copy</strong>.<br>3. If you want to edit the checklist in Excel, select <strong> File &gt; Download</strong>, and choose <strong>Microsoft Excel (xlsx)</strong>. Note that some file resizing may be required in order to download.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J2CMVCT03K1BYJYVFFKRSFJ4\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/getting-started-with-klaviyo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting started with Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/getting-started-with-sms/1411601\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting started with SMS and MMS for the first time</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005054847\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to create and send an email campaign</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
